    folder:`<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 7h7l2 2h9v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 2h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/></svg>`,
